---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
---
<Layout title_cy="Egwyddorion Nolan" title_en="Nolan Principles">
  <div class="page-banner"><h1><span lang="cy">Egwyddorion Nolan</span><span lang="en">Nolan Principles</span></h1></div>
  <div class="breadcrumb">
    <a href="/"><span lang="cy">Hafan</span><span lang="en">Home</span></a> &rsaquo;
    <a href="/documents/"><span lang="cy">Dogfennau</span><span lang="en">Documents</span></a> &rsaquo;
    <span lang="cy">Egwyddorion Nolan</span><span lang="en">Nolan Principles</span>
  </div>
  <div class="site-wrap"><div class="content" data-pagefind-body>
    <h2 class="sh"><span lang="cy">Saith Egwyddor Bywyd Cyhoeddus</span><span lang="en">The Seven Principles of Public Life</span></h2><hr class="sh-rule">

    <p lang="cy">Sefydlwyd yr Egwyddorion hyn gan Bwyllgor Nolan yn 1995 ac maent yn sail i ymddygiad pob person sy'n gweithio yn y sector cyhoeddus, gan gynnwys cynghorwyr cymunedol.</p>
    <p lang="en">These Principles were established by the Nolan Committee in 1995 and underpin the conduct of everyone working in the public sector, including community councillors.</p>

    <ol style="padding-left:1.5rem;line-height:2">
      <li>
        <strong><span lang="cy">Anhunanoldeb</span><span lang="en">Selflessness</span></strong> —
        <span lang="cy">Dylid gweithredu yn unig er budd y cyhoedd.</span>
        <span lang="en">Holders of public office should act solely in terms of the public interest.</span>
      </li>
      <li>
        <strong><span lang="cy">Uniondeb</span><span lang="en">Integrity</span></strong> —
        <span lang="cy">Ni ddylid cymryd rhwymedigaethau ariannol nac eraill tuag at unigolion neu sefydliadau allanol a allai ddylanwadu'n amhriodol ar eu gwaith.</span>
        <span lang="en">Must not place themselves under any financial or other obligation to outside individuals or organisations that might seek to influence them.</span>
      </li>
      <li>
        <strong><span lang="cy">Gwrthrychedd</span><span lang="en">Objectivity</span></strong> —
        <span lang="cy">Rhaid gwneud penderfyniadau yn unig ar sail haeddiant.</span>
        <span lang="en">Must act and take decisions impartially, fairly and on merit.</span>
      </li>
      <li>
        <strong><span lang="cy">Atebolrwydd</span><span lang="en">Accountability</span></strong> —
        <span lang="cy">Rhaid atebol i'r cyhoedd am benderfyniadau a chamau gweithredu.</span>
        <span lang="en">Must be accountable to the public for decisions and actions.</span>
      </li>
      <li>
        <strong><span lang="cy">Agoredrwydd</span><span lang="en">Openness</span></strong> —
        <span lang="cy">Dylid bod mor agored â phosib am benderfyniadau a chamau gweithredu.</span>
        <span lang="en">Should be as open as possible about decisions and actions.</span>
      </li>
      <li>
        <strong><span lang="cy">Gonestedd</span><span lang="en">Honesty</span></strong> —
        <span lang="cy">Rhaid datgelu unrhyw fudd preifat sy'n berthnasol i ddyletswyddau cyhoeddus.</span>
        <span lang="en">Must declare any private interests relating to public duties.</span>
      </li>
      <li>
        <strong><span lang="cy">Arweinyddiaeth</span><span lang="en">Leadership</span></strong> —
        <span lang="cy">Dylid hyrwyddo a chefnogi'r egwyddorion hyn drwy arweinyddiaeth a pheri enghraifft.</span>
        <span lang="en">Should promote and support these principles by leadership and example.</span>
      </li>
    </ol>

    <p><a href="/documents/code-of-conduct/"><span lang="cy">Côd Ymddygiad →</span><span lang="en">Code of Conduct →</span></a></p>
  </div></div>
</Layout>
